cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lean-LCS: locally convex spaces in Lean 4 and Mathlib"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of locally convex topological vector spaces, their duality
  and completeness theory, and closed graph and open mapping theorems, built on Mathlib.
  It includes barrelled, bornological, ultrabornological, reflexive, Montel and Pták
  spaces, the bipolar, Alaoglu–Bourbaki, Mackey–Arens, Krein–Šmulian and Grothendieck
  theorems, strict inductive limits, and webbed spaces with De Wilde's theorems.
authors:
  - family-names: Braams
    given-names: Bastiaan J.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bjbraams/lean-LCS"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - locally convex spaces
  - topological vector spaces
  - functional analysis
